From 3ca62782e1e28872a313936fbf1e71ec99c8ece8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (KingdomShift build)" <claude@kingdomshift.live>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 19:48:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace Kingdom Dual with Kingdom Response react feature

- Kingdom Response: stacked layout (source video top, camera bottom)
- Supports both an existing post OR a device-picked video as source
- Pause/resume control on source video during recording (camera keeps rolling)
- Retake/Save to Gallery/Use in a Post review flow (same pattern as Kingdom Dual)
- Recordings tagged content_type: kingdom_response, saved into a Reactions tab on profile (reusing Kingdom Dual's tab mechanism)
- Nav bar entry point now opens Kingdom Response instead of Kingdom Dual
- Removed dual_camera_screen.dart entirely (no longer referenced anywhere)
- Added file_picker dependency for the device video picker
